  note = {The optimization lineage of the term the text uses for durability. The method carries a temperature that permits uphill moves and lowers it on a schedule, so the quality of the result is a property of the schedule rather than of the objective: cooled too fast, the search freezes into the first tolerable arrangement it reached. The name is itself borrowed from metallurgy, which is why the book's use is a third stop for the word -- the metal, the search, then the training run -- rather than a fresh metaphor.}
